      "notes": {
        "ar-ocr": "Below release: Tesseract 'ara' does not read Arabic-Indic digits in any font or model measured (fast, script/Arabic, tessdata_best ara and script/Arabic) -- the installed fast model's character set holds one of the ten (U+0660) and neither Arabic separator -- and its layout analysis skips a heading and a paragraph (both are read when cropped). Token recall 0.66, CER 0.24, WER 0.29 against the whole page (corpus version 4).",
